# Launcher defaults (Windows and the SteamOS-like Linux PC). Do not edit this
# file: an install replaces it. Put your own KEY=value lines in
# config/launch.env (in the user-data folder); they win over these.
# Any RECOMP_* key from docs/running.md works there, e.g. RECOMP_USB_PADS=1.
# The GPU through Direct3D 11 (DXVK under Proton), on a toolkit that has it
# (the xboxrecomp fork). Upstream's toolkit ignores the key and draws in
# software. On the fork, RECOMP_PB_BACKEND=cpu picks the software renderer.
RECOMP_PB_BACKEND=d3d11
# The Proton build umu-run uses on the Linux PC (ignored on Windows).
PROTONPATH=GE-Proton
# Game logs kept in logs/.
LOG_KEEP=10
